{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>原隻米鴨熬湯!炙燒慢煮嫩滑鴨胸</p><p>鴨蔥拉麵小店進駐深水埗西九龍中心</p><p>將軍澳美食廣場木馬工房主打日本大熱鴨蔥拉麵的小店，上年憑藉價錢親民的鴨蔥拉麵而一炮而紅！最近小店於深水埗西九龍中心6樓開設新分店，由9月1日至9日7日首10位到店顧客，仲可以免費享用招牌「鴨蔥拉麵」乙碗！</p><p>原隻米鴨熬湯＋炙燒慢煮鴨胸</p><p>店定主打價錢親民$68起鴨蔥拉麵，採用原隻米鴨熬湯，100%每日熬足8小時，純天然不添加味精。每碗都鋪上炙燒慢煮鴨胸，鴨胸肉質柔軟粉嫩，湯底有淡淡鴨鮮味，清爽甘甜，加埋大蔥和黑松露油，香氣十足！</p><p>鴨蔥自家製拉麵 地址: 深水埗西九龍中心6樓美食廣場6FC45-47號 官方IG：@kamonegi.ramen</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178841542667675238_12257978426a990dc419f4f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178841543047972874_8819889056a990dc6c8490.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178841543201313574_7634010536a990dc8af9d8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178841543394252829_14756213046a990dca43275.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17884154357939509_8196023416a990dcc47535.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178841543755871891_19226101406a990dce1d4e6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178841543937273196_19588925066a990dcfb3ed7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T06:23:51.726958+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}